{
  "name": "The Rearing Strait",
  "provenance": "Composed for this pack by Claude (designer agentling), 2026-08-11. Scene, plates and ops are original: the three raster layers (far.png, mid.png, near.png) were drawn by me with HTML canvas through the render_plate tool, from no external art. Staging, palette and light are read from the reference image supplied with the job, input/wine-dark-strait-v1-plate.png — the first version's single plate of this same world, itself a machine render commissioned for this level series; nothing from that file is embedded or traced here, only its mood (low sun-break upper left, storm and rain upper right, dark serpent silhouette right of centre) reproduced with my own geometry. Motif from Homer's Odyssey, public domain; no studio designs, marks or names are used.",
